// cond304 — a matching If-Modified-Since yields 304 Not Modified
// with no body (ws02 §2 conditional GET). nginx's 304 header set:
// Server, Date, Last-Modified, Connection, ETag.
--- request
GET /index.html HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1
If-Modified-Since: Thu, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT
Connection: close

--- expect
HTTP/1.1 304 Not Modified
Server: <normalized>
Date: <normalized>
Last-Modified: Thu, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT
Connection: close
ETag: "6955b900-4e"

